<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>ArogyaSetu — Setup, .env.example &amp; License</title></head>
<body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.5;color:#111827;">
  <h1 style="color:#0f172a;font-size:20pt;border-bottom:2px solid #2563eb;padding-bottom:6px;">ArogyaSetu — Setup Guide, .env.example &amp; MIT License</h1>

  <h2 style="color:#1e3a8a;font-size:15pt;">1. Local Setup &amp; Verification Commands</h2>
  <pre style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10pt;"># 1. Backend Setup (Port 8000)
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
python -m pip install -r backend/requirements.txt
python -m uvicorn backend.main:app --reload --port 8000

# 2. Frontend Setup (Port 3000)
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev

# 3. Run Regression Tests (14 tests)
python -m unittest backend/tests/test_core.py backend/tests/test_api.py</pre>

  <h2 style="color:#1e3a8a;font-size:15pt;">2. Environment Variables Template (<code>.env.example</code>)</h2>
  <pre style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:10px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:10pt;">APP_ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
PORT=8000
DATABASE_PATH=
ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000,http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
ENABLE_EXTERNAL_ROUTING=true
ENABLE_EXTERNAL_CHAT=false
GROQ_API_KEY=</pre>

